  "title": "Contributing to the Design of Energy‑Efficient, Robust Pyrolysis Plants at Scale Through Advanced Instrumentation",
  "summary": "As advanced recycling moves from pilot projects to industrial scale deployment across Europe, pyrolysis OEMs face a common challenge such as scaling quickly while maintaining energy efficiency, robust design, and reliable long-term operation. Achieving this requires more than individual instruments: it requires a partner who understands the realities of high temperature, variable feedstock processes and works alongside OEM teams from design through deployment. […]",
